		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Select .... très sélectif]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=32019#p32019"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Re<br />Un ami m&#039;a aidé entre temps.<br />Voilà ce que je cherchais ;-)</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT regexp_match(r.rolname,&#039;^[a-zA-Z0-9]{2}[0-9]{5}$&#039;) as username,r1.rolname as &quot;role&quot;
FROM pg_catalog.pg_roles r LEFT JOIN pg_catalog.pg_auth_members m
ON (m.member = r.oid)
LEFT JOIN pg_roles r1 ON (m.roleid=r1.oid) where r1.rolname is null
ORDER BY 1
;</code></pre></div>]]></content>
